{
    "background_story": "Deep within the ancient forests of Juglandales, a mystical realm of walnut trees, Raiden was born from the sacred energies of the land. As a tree spirit, he embodied the wisdom and strength of the forest. With skin as rough as bark and hair that flowed like leaves, Raiden roamed the woods, protecting the delicate balance of nature. He communed with the trees, listening to their whispers and learning the secrets of the forest. Raiden's presence was a calming balm to the trees, and they flourished under his care. As the seasons changed, he would weave powerful magic to ensure the continued health and prosperity of the forest. The creatures of Juglandales revered Raiden as a guardian and a symbol of the enduring spirit of the natural world.",
